                                        <button class="cky-accordion-btn" aria-label="Necessary" data-cky-tag="detail-category-title" style="color: #212121">Necessary</button><span class="cky-always-active">Always Active</span>
                                        <div class="cky-switch" data-cky-tag="detail-category-toggle">
                                            <input type="checkbox" id="ckySwitchnecessary"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="cky-accordion-header-des" data-cky-tag="detail-category-description" style="color: #212121">
                                        <p>Necessary cookies are required to enable the basic features of this site, such as providing secure log-in or adjusting your consent preferences. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable data.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
